A||||6||sqoach||A few pics of our recent California trip||||7||
Z||000000||sqoach||08-25-2001||11:53 PM||||Decided to post a few pics of our trip since I'm bored. The picture quality is not the best, but what do you expect from a $100 digicam?<P>Went to the Tonight Show on Tuesday. My parents are big fans. Waiting in line sucked, but it was pretty neat being there.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jayleno_1_1.JPG"> <P>Here's a nice view while driving up Highway 101. It was a beautiful drive.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/oceanside_1.JPG"> <P>Cruisin' down one of the many steep streets in San Francisco. My dad was pretty nervous driving around here  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sanfranstreet_1.JPG"> <P>And here's a pic of the fam. This was taken in Solvang, a very neat Danish town. It was cool. *Starting from front left: Me, younger sister, younger brother, Dad, Mom, older sister*<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fam_1.JPG"> <P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">   <P>84 SE (FOR SALE)*sale pending*<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR>86 SC (FOR SALE)<BR>86 SE V6 (new project)||||reg||7
Z||000001||Tigger||08-26-2001||12:04 AM||||Cool family!<P>I'd like to meet Jay someday.<P>Lol, note to self, make sure your parking brake works in San Fran!  Just once I'd like to take a $100 car down one of those streets as fast as I could get it to go.  I could see it bottoming out and getting air going through that intersection.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_drunk.gif">||||reg||1
